  "title": "Cuba's Raúl Castro's Grandson and the Cuban Mafia in Mexico, U.S. and Iran Escalate War Over Oil Tankers, and Haiti's Political Violence",
  "summary": "Cuba's Raúl Castro's Grandson and the Cuban Mafia in Mexico, a rescue operation in Bengal Coast, and U.S. and Iran Escalate War Over Oil Tankers are reported. Meanwhile, Haiti's political violence and a humanitarian relief event are also highlighted.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "A large cargo ship carrying fuel to Cuba was intercepted by the U.S. Coast Guard, marking a continuation of the U.S. oil embargo against Cuba.",
