    },
    {
      "statement": "A rescue operation was initiated after a maritime disaster in Bengal Coast, with U.S. and Iran escalating military actions over the Strait of Hormuz.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "More than a dozen individuals were arrested in connection with the 2021 assassination of Haitian President Jovenel Moïse, with eight of them extradited to Miami.",
